          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake amũea Atasisa, nake nĩ Esita, mwĩĩtu wa mwendw’aĩthe: nũndũ ndaĩ na ĩthe o na nyinyia, na mwĩĩtu ũsu aĩ mwanake na mũseo; na yĩla ĩthe na nyinyia makwie, Molitekai amwosa ethĩwe mwĩĩtu wake mwene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, yĩla mwĩao wa mũsumbĩ na ũtw’ĩo wake weew’ĩkie, na eĩtu aingĩ moombanĩw’a nyũmbanĩ nene ya ũsumbĩ ku Susani, ũsũvĩonĩ kwa Ekai, Esita atwawa nyũmbanĩ ya mũsumbĩ, ku ũsũvĩonĩ kwa Ekai, mũsũvĩi wa aka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũla mwĩĩtu amwendeesya, na oona ũseo kwake; na amũnenga na mĩtũkĩ syĩndũ syake kwondũ wa kwĩthesya, vamwe na malĩu make, na anengwa eĩtu mũonza ala maĩle ũnengwa kuma nyũmbanĩ ya mũsumbĩ: na amũthamĩĩsya e na eĩtu make vandũ vala vaseo mbee nyũmbanĩ ya aka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esita ndaamanyĩthan’ya andũ make kana ũko wake; nũndũ Molitekai nĩwamwĩaĩĩte kana ndakaamanyĩthan’ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Molitekai nĩwangangaa kĩla mũthenya mbee wa nza ya nyũmba ya aka, amanye ũndũ Esita ũilyĩ, na ũndũ wĩmũtw’ĩkĩkĩa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ yĩla kyathĩ kyavikie kya kĩla mwĩĩtu kũenda kwa mũsumbĩ Aasuelo, ĩtina wa kwĩkĩwa kwake kwĩanana na mwĩao wa aka myei ĩkũmi na ĩlĩ (nũndũ ũu waĩ wĩanĩsyo wa kwĩthesya kwoo, atĩĩ, myei thanthatũ ya mauta ma manemane, na myei thanthatũ ya syĩndũ syĩ mũuke mũseo vamwe na syĩndũ sya kwĩthesya sya aka), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nĩvo ĩndĩ kĩla mwĩĩtu waendie kwa mũsumbĩ kũatĩĩa maũndũ aa: kĩla wendaa nĩwanengiwe kũthi nakyo kuma nyũmbanĩ ya aka kũvika nyũmbanĩ ya mũsumbĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Athi wĩoo, na kĩoko auma athi nyũmbanĩ ya kelĩ ya aka, ũsũvĩonĩ kwa Saasikasi, mũvakũe wa kwa mũsumbĩ, ũla wasũvĩaa aka ngombo: ndaalika kwa mũsumbĩ ĩngĩ, ate o mũsumbĩ nĩwendeew’e nĩwe, na eetwa na syĩtwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.4.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 4.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ yĩla kyathĩ kya Esita kyavikie kya kũthi kwa mũsumbĩ, mwĩĩtu wa Aviaili mwendw’a‐ĩthe wa Molitekai, ũla wamwosete ethĩwe mwĩĩtu wake, ndaaenda kĩndũ o na kĩva no kĩla Ekai mũvakũe wa kwa mũsumbĩ, mũsũvĩi wa aka, watw’ĩte. Na Esita oona ũseo methonĩ ma onthe ala mamũsyaĩĩsye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
