          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla eĩtu asu atheu moombaniw’e ĩvinda ya kelĩ, nĩvo Molitekai wekalile nthĩ mbingĩlonĩ kwa mũsumbĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esita ndaĩ anamba kũmanyĩthan’ya ũko wake kana andũ make; o tondũ Molitekai wamwĩaĩĩte: nũndũ Esita eekĩte o tondũ Molitekai wamwĩaĩaa, o ta yĩla waeiwe nĩwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mĩthenya ĩsu, yĩla Molitekai wekalaa nthĩ mbingĩlonĩ kwa mũsumbĩ, avakũe elĩ ma kwa mũsumbĩ, Mbikithana na Telesi, ma asu ala masũvĩaa myalyonĩ, mathilĩka, na mamantha kũmũkwata mũsumbĩ Aasuelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
